@startuml
title SSAFIT Playlist 전체 Use Case 개요
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "비회원" as Guest
actor "일반 회원" as Member
actor "Spotify 연동 회원" as SpotifyMember
actor "개발자/운영자" as Operator
actor "Spotify API" as SpotifyAPI
actor "OpenAI 호환 API" as OpenAIAPI

Member --|> Guest
SpotifyMember --|> Member

rectangle "SSAFIT Playlist" {
  usecase "UC-001\n회원가입\n(FR-001)" as UC001
  usecase "UC-002\n로그인\n(FR-002)" as UC002
  usecase "UC-005\n러닝 프로필 관리\n(FR-005)" as UC005 <<partial>>
  usecase "UC-006\n러닝 기록 관리\n(FR-006)" as UC006
  usecase "UC-007\n러닝 세션 관리\n(FR-007)" as UC007
  usecase "UC-008\n음악 조회/검색\n(FR-008)" as UC008
  usecase "UC-010\n음악 리뷰 관리\n(FR-010)" as UC010
  usecase "UC-011\n플레이리스트 관리\n(FR-011)" as UC011
  usecase "UC-014\n자동 큐레이션\n(FR-014)" as UC014
  usecase "UC-015\n운동 데이터 기반 추천\n(FR-015)" as UC015
  usecase "UC-017\nSpotify 곡 검색\n(FR-017)" as UC017
  usecase "UC-018\nSpotify OAuth 연결\n(FR-018)" as UC018 <<partial>>
  usecase "UC-020\nSpotify 내보내기\n(FR-019)" as UC020 <<partial>>
  usecase "UC-022\nDocker 기반 실행\n(FR-022)" as UC022
  usecase "UC-024\nAI 러닝 리포트\n(FR-021)" as UC024 <<partial>>
}

Guest --> UC001
Guest --> UC002
Guest --> UC008

Member --> UC005
Member --> UC006
Member --> UC007
Member --> UC010
Member --> UC011
Member --> UC014
Member --> UC015
Member --> UC017

SpotifyMember --> UC018
SpotifyMember --> UC020

Operator --> UC022
Member --> UC024

SpotifyAPI --> UC017
SpotifyAPI --> UC018
SpotifyAPI --> UC020
OpenAIAPI --> UC024

UC014 ..> UC015 : <<include>>
UC020 ..> UC018 : <<include>>

note right of UC005
  API와 JSP는 구현됨.
  발표 기준 실제 화면은 JSP.
  Vue 전용 프로필 화면은 후속 SPA 통합 과제.
end note

note right of UC020
  코드와 UI는 있으나
  실제 Spotify 계정/권한/API 정책 검증 필요.
end note
@enduml
